DIFME D2 modernisation (2026-11-23): Spring Boot 4.1 / Spring 7 / Camel 4.22 need Jakarta EE: javax.servlet, javax.validation,
javax.ws.rs, javax.xml.bind, javax.annotation.* -> jakarta.*; Camel 4's CXF JAX-RS client (camel-cxf-spring-rest) has the
namespace http://camel.apache.org/schema/cxf/jaxrs (endpoints.xml); springfox removed (the Docket bean and its UI mapping;
springdoc serves the docs); Jackson 2.21 removed mappingException(String); spring.jackson.serialization
WRITE_DATES_AS_TIMESTAMPS dropped (Jackson 3 under Spring Boot 4 has no such feature and writes ISO dates by default). Versions and Java 21 are set in deploy/images/mifos-ph-ee/vendored-common.gradle (no build file edited).

